steps:
Open frontend/src/index.css. Locate the .filter-chip.active block (ends around line 542). Immediately after it, insert the .filter-chip-lg modifier with its required specificity comment:

/* .filter-chip-lg MUST appear after .filter-chip in source order —
   it overrides padding and font-size using the same specificity,
   so source order is the only differentiator. */
.filter-chip-lg {
  padding: 10px 20px;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}

In the same index.css file, locate the ADMIN LAYOUT block comment (around line 2053, which reads '/* ═══...ADMIN LAYOUT...═══ */'). Immediately before that comment, inside the DASHBOARD PAGE & SECTIONS block, insert the following rules:

/* ─── Dashboard Tab Bar ─── */
.dashboard-tabs {
  display: flex;
  gap: 8px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.dashboard-tab-btn {
  padding: 10px 28px;
  border-radius: var(--r-full);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: var(--card-bg);
  color: var(--text-muted);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all var(--t-base);
  font-family: inherit;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.dashboard-tab-btn:hover {
  border-color: var(--primary);
  color: var(--primary);
  background: rgba(108, 99, 255, 0.1);
}

.dashboard-tab-btn.active {
  border-color: var(--primary);
  color: #fff;
  background: var(--grad-primary);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(108, 99, 255, 0.35);
}

.dashboard-tab-btn:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--primary);
  outline-offset: 2px;
}

Note: write these as flat top-level rules, NOT nested inside any other rule block.
